+\end{lemma}
+\begin{proof}
+	\leanok
+	\uses{def:pasting-tensor-placement, lem:pasting-measurement}
+	At a fixed question each of the three defects equals $\|\psi\|^2$ minus the
+	corresponding diagonal overlap, so it suffices to compare the overlaps. Since
+	the answer effects sum to the identity, the two right-hand overlaps are
+	summed over the answer pairs, and it suffices to compare, for each answer
+	pair $(a_1, a_2)$, the operator $(G_2)^x_{[\operatorname{eval}_{y_2}(\cdot) =
